        <p>A GROUP AT PENKETII. Standing (left to right): Messrs. Hampson, Long, Aldcroft, Wood, Moss, Moores, Bell, A. Irampson, Kirkham, Alainley, Dumbill, Faulkner and Dodds. Seated : Mr. Foden (secretary), Mrs. Garnett (president), Mrs. Dodds, Mr. Clare (sports secretary).</p>
