        <p>Stockton Heath Football Club. The annual general meeting of the Stockton Heath Rugby Union Football Club will be held at the Mul- berry Tree Hotel, Stockton Heath, on Friday, August 27th at 7.30 p.m. Water Polo. • Water polo enthusiasts are reminded that Warring- ton will play Birkenhead at the. Legh-street Baths on Tuesday evening next. Two works squadron races will also be decided. Visit of a Famous Band. A musical treat will be afforded the Warrington public on Monday next, when the band of H.M. Irish Band will give two military concerts in the Parr Hall. Mr. Hassall will oonduct.</p>
